承认这些材料统统没有价值。", "confidence": 0.9176992899493167, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[285.0, 777.0], [729.0, 777.0], [729.0, 800.0], [285.0, 800.0]], "text": "时间、地点、人物、事件，她统统不记得。", "confidence": 0.9004101097583771, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[127.0, 835.0], [333.0, 835.0], [333.0, 860.0], [127.0, 860.0]], "text": "【七一九015】唯独", "confidence": 0.8522865067828785, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[285.0, 875.0], [698.0, 875.0], [698.0, 898.0], [285.0, 898.0]], "text": "全班同学都在认真听讲，唯独他在睡觉", "confidence": 0.913796623547872, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[285.0, 913.0], [746.0, 914.0], [746.0, 938.0], [285.0, 937.0]], "text": "他什么都不在乎，唯独受不了家人的不理解", "confidence": 0.8984167695045471, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[128.0, 974.0], [346.0, 974.0], [346.0, 1000.0], [128.0, 1000.0]], "text": "A.7.1.4.3时间副词", "confidence": 0.921930594103677, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[125.0, 1037.0], [307.0, 1035.0], [308.0, 1062.0], [126.0, 1064.0]], "text": "【七一九016】即", "confidence": 0.832724604010582, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[285.0, 1076.0], [826.0, 1076.0], [826.0, 1101.0], [285.0, 1101.0]], "text": "对待教育问题，不宜忽视，要严肃对待，有错即改。", "confidence": 0.9176144028703371, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[286.0, 1116.0], [873.0, 1116.0], [873.0, 1139.0], [286.0, 1139.0]], "text": "西北人张口即来的这种民歌，是高原上一道美丽的风景。", "confidence": 0.9167146361791171, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[127.0, 1173.0], [332.0, 1173.0], [332.0, 1199.0], [127.0, 1199.0]], "text": "【七一九017】历来", "confidence": 0.7966924418102611, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[285.0, 1213.0], [681.0, 1214.0], [681.0, 1237.0], [285.0, 1236.0]], "text": "王老师历来重视培养学生的动手能力。", "confidence": 0.9030037754111819, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[284.0, 1250.0], [777.0, 1250.0], [777.0, 1276.0], [284.0, 1276.0]], "text": "流行歌曲历来是社会文化不可以缺少的一部分。", "confidence": 0.8689974681897596, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[127.0, 1311.0], [308.0, 1311.0], [308.0, 1337.0], [127.0, 1337.0]], "text": "【七一九018】尚", "confidence": 0.8019777595996856, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[284.0, 1352.0], [607.0, 1352.0], [607.0, 1374.0], [284.0, 1374.0]], "text": "这个调查到现在为止尚无进展。", "confidence": 0.903984785079956, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[284.0, 1390.0], [633.0, 1390.0], [633.0, 1413.0], [284.0, 1413.0]], "text": "这个问题想研究明白，尚需努力。", "confidence": 0.8641960322856903, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[128.0, 1445.0], [333.0, 1447.0], [332.0, 1474.0], [127.0, 1472.0]], "text": "【七一九019】向来", "confidence": 0.8226569457487627, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[288.0, 1489.0], [702.0, 1489.0], [702.0, 1509.0], [288.0, 1509.0]], "text": "他这个人向来吃软不吃硬，你不能硬来。", "confidence": 0.8554993867874146, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[286.0, 1527.0], [654.0, 1527.0], [654.0, 1550.0], [286.0, 1550.0]], "text": "他向来第一个到学校，从未迟到过。", "confidence": 0.8830756545066833, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[128.0, 1589.0], [417.0, 1588.0], [417.0, 1611.0], [128.0, 1613.0]], "text": "A.7.1.4.4频率、重复副词", "confidence": 0.9082633712712456, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[127.0, 1649.0], [333.0, 1649.0], [333.0, 1675.0], [127.0, 1675.0]], "text": "【七一九020】频频", "confidence": 0.8413965376940641, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[286.0, 1690.0], [729.0, 1690.0], [729.0, 1713.0], [286.0, 1713.0]], "text": "他频频与朋友们以及他的竞争者们打招呼。", "confidence": 0.9115081518888474, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[286.0, 1729.0], [846.0, 1729.0], [846.0, 1751.0], [286.0, 1751.0]], "text": "气氛十分热烈，大家频频举杯，说笑不停，非常高兴。", "confidence": 0.9152208137512207, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[153.0, 1786.0], [190.0, 1786.0], [190.0, 1809.0], [153.0, 1809.0]], "text": "238", "confidence": 0.6581362187862396, "needs_review": false}]